<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>?</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div style = "text-align: center; position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);">
      <span style = "font-size: 30px; margin: 30px;">You get lost and, in your wandering attempts to find your way back, find yourself in a basement. There's a girl.</span>
      <br><br><br>
      <img src = "i/secretflan.png" style = "margin: 30px; width: 35%; float: left;">
      <div class = "textbox">
        Why did you come here? Oh, you must be one of the stupid ones. I remember, I remember... she said I had to help the stupid ones that wander off. Okay, I'll help you go back. It should be no problem even for the likes of you.
        Here, <a href="https://ame.fish">hold my hand and I'll show you the way back</a>.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

